{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/05-derivation-work-queueing/003-implementor.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\"command\":\"story-implement\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"cca27c1d-9183-4255-ab38-93220d4a60d0\",\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"model\":\"claude-fable-5\",\"role\":\"story_implementor\",\"sessionId\":\"7ab0ad27-af7b-46f6-9ce5-aa43cce928f8\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"7ab0ad27-af7b-46f6-9ce5-aa43cce928f8\",\"storyId\":\"05-derivation-work-queueing\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-derivation-work-queueing\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Derivation Work Queueing\"},\"planSummary\":\"TDD-lite walk extension. Red: wrote test/work-queue.test.ts (11 tests: TC-2.6/2.7/2.9, TC-3.3/3.6 work halves, TC-3.8 work count, TC-5.4 no-work-item clause, restart-survival incl. work items, complete-surface rollback, two CLI in-process legs) plus a process-suite leg, recorded both in the red manifest, confirmed 11 assertion-level failures with red-verify clean. Green: added thread-schema migration v4 (work_item table, committing with the batch); implemented the domain-blind work-queue util (recordItem with deterministic w-<sourceId>-<kind> ids, listItems ordered by queue order, filtered by owner); messages.queueMessageWork with the exact kind gate (user_prompt→prompt_smoothing, tool_result→tool_result_summary, nothing else) and real listQueuedWork; turn-close queueing added to both Story 4 close paths via a closeTurnAndQueueWork helper inside applyEvent, TurnTransitionOutcome extended with queuedWork, real turns.listQueuedWork; pipeline collects items in walk order and surfaces identity-only {workItemId, owner, kind, sourceRef} entries in BatchResult.queuedWork. CLI commands were already routed and went live with the domain implementations. Performed the named exit step: field-by-field review of the shipped WorkItemRecord against the epic's Work Item contract table (lines 348-355 of 01-epic.md) — workItemId unique per thread (PRIMARY KEY), owner values, the three kinds paired to correct owners, sourceRef {messageId}|{turnId}, status literal 'queued', queuedAt from the injected clock, and the batch-result entry shape per line 332 — no drift found.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"recordItem and listItems mechanics: deterministic w-<sourceId>-<kind> ids, queue-order listing filtered by owner; domain-blind, no public SDK surface\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/threads/internal/create.ts\",\"reason\":\"schema migration v4: work_item table in the thread file so items commit and roll back with the batch transaction; status left unconstrained TEXT for Epic 02's lifecycle statuses\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"queueMessageWork with the exact kind gate (prompt/tool_result only, owner messages); real listQueuedWork read-back; removed a pre-existing unused DatabaseSync import\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"turn_derivation item queued on both close paths (close and close_then_open) inside the same transaction; TurnTransitionOutcome extended with queuedWork; real listQueuedWork read-back\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/intake-stream/internal/pipeline.ts\",\"reason\":\"queue step in the walk: turn items collected from applyEvent outcomes, message items via queueMessageWork after projection, gated on recorded; queuedWork populated in BatchResult in walk order\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/work-queue.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Red-phase suite for the story: all TC mappings, both architecture-risk regressions, CLI in-process legs (recorded in red manifest before implementation)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-work-queue.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"process-suite leg: turns list-queued-work and queuedWork batch-result half through the spawned binary\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/smoke.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Story 0 fail-closed-stub rail test retired with its last two entries (both list-queued-work commands now live); same prior-story-update pattern Story 4 used, hash re-recorded\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"process-boundary stub proof rewritten as the live structured-error proof (thread_not_found through the real binary) since no stubbed command remains; hash re-recorded\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/thread-migration.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"expected post-migration schema version bumped 3 to 4 for the new work_item migration; hash re-recorded\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\"reason\":\"recorded hashes for the two new Red files and the three legitimately updated prior-story files\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\",\"reason\":\"registered cli-process-work-queue.test.ts in the process-suite exclude list so it runs under verify-all only\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.7 prompt + tool result durably queue their kinds, owner messages, queuedAt from injected clock\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.9 text/thinking/note queue nothing — exact kind gate\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.6 mixed-batch result complete: outcomes, messageIds, transitions, queuedWork, threadPosition\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.3 work half — explicit close queues w-t1-turn_derivation, owner turns\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.6 work half — implicit close queues the same item contract as explicit\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.8 work count — multi-turn batch queues one turn_derivation per closed turn\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-5.4 no-work-item clause — skipped events queue nothing, full read-back at baseline\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: architecture-risk restart survival extended to work items (openRaw row scan + reopen read-back)\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: architecture-risk complete-surface rollback — rejected batch leaves events, messages, turns, work at baseline\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: CLI in-process — both list-queued-work commands return only their owner's items\",\"test/work-queue.test.ts: CLI in-process — list-queued-work on unknown thread id fails thread_not_found\",\"test/cli-process-work-queue.test.ts: turns list-queued-work and batch-result queuedWork through the spawned binary\"],\"modified\":[\"test/smoke.test.ts: removed the fail-closed-stub rail test (list went empty — every planned command is now live)\",\"test/cli-process.test.ts: stub-through-binary proof became the live structured-error proof\",\"test/thread-migration.test.ts: post-migration schema version expectation 3 → 4\"],\"removed\":[\"test/smoke.test.ts: 'every planned command routes to a fail-closed stub with the exact stub error shape' (vacuous once the last stubs went live)\"],\"totalAfterStory\":111,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":11},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"npx vitest run test/work-queue.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --dir /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --dir /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Removed a pre-existing unused DatabaseSync type import from src/domains/messages/index.ts while editing its import block\",\"Three prior-story tests hard-coded pre-Story-5 state (stub routing in smoke.test.ts and cli-process.test.ts, schema version 3 in thread-migration.test.ts); updated them to the new reality and re-recorded hashes, following the exact pattern Story 4 used for the same files\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"Within a single event, a close-triggered turn_derivation item precedes that event's message item in both result order and rowid order (transition runs before projection in the walk); no spec pins intra-event ordering, but Epic 02 should not assume message items precede turn items\",\"work_item.status is unconstrained TEXT (no CHECK), deliberately: this epic writes only 'queued' through code, and Epic 02 adds lifecycle statuses without a schema migration\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Story verification, then epic close-out: the full TC table is green end to end (verify-all 111/111), Story 4's TC-3.3/TC-3.6 work-half debt is paid, the AC-4.6 rollback ladder is closed with the complete-surface regression, and the WorkItemRecord shape review against the epic contract table is done with no drift — this receipt records that named exit step.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/05-derivation-work-queueing/003-implementor.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-10T14:50:05.133Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-10T15:05:06.318Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
