ued-work and queuedWork batch-result half through the spawned binary\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"packages/lhc/test/smoke.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Story 0 fail-closed-stub rail test retired with its last two entries (both list-queued-work commands now live); same prior-story-update pattern Story 4 used, hash re-recorded\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"process-boundary stub proof rewritten as the live structured-error proof (thread_not_found through the real binary) since no stubbed command remains; hash re-recorded\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"packages/lhc/test/thread-migration.test.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"expected post-migration schema version bumped 3 to 4 for the new work_item migration; hash re-recorded\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"recorded hashes for the two new Red files and the three legitimately updated prior-story files\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"registered cli-process-work-queue.test.ts in the process-suite exclude list so it runs under verify-all only\\\"}],\\\"tests\\\":{\\\"added\\\":[\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.7 prompt + tool result durably queue their kinds, owner messages, queuedAt from injected clock\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.9 text/thinking/note queue nothing — exact kind gate\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-2.6 mixed-batch result complete: outcomes, messageIds, transitions, queuedWork, threadPosition\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.3 work half — explicit close queues w-t1-turn_derivation, owner turns\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.6 work half — implicit close queues the same item contract as explicit\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-3.8 work count — multi-turn batch queues one turn_derivation per closed turn\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: TC-5.4 no-work-item clause — skipped events queue nothing, full read-back at baseline\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: architecture-risk restart survival extended to work items (openRaw row scan + reopen read-back)\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: architecture-risk complete-surface rollback — rejected batch leaves events, messages, turns, work at baseline\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: CLI in-process — both list-queued-work commands return only their owner's items\\\",\\\"test/work-queue.test.ts: CLI in-process — list-queued-work on unknown thread id fails thread_not_found\\\",\\\"test/cli-process-work-queue.test.ts: turns list-queued-work and batch-result queuedWork through the spawned binary\\\"],\\\"modified\\\":[\\\"test/smoke.test.ts: removed the fail-closed-stub rail test (list went empty — every planned command is now live)\\\",\\\"test/cli-process.test.ts: stub-through-binary proof became the live structured-error proof\\\",\\\"test/thread-migration.test.ts: post-migration schema version expectation 3 → 4\\\"],\\\"removed\\\":[\\\"test/smoke.test.ts: 'every planned command routes to a fail-closed stub with the exact stub error shape' (vacuous once the last stubs went live)\\\"],\\\"totalAfterStory\\\":111,\\\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\\\":11},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"npx vitest run test/work-queue.test.ts\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --dir /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"pnpm --dir /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"}],\\\"selfReview\\\":{\\\"passesRun\\\":0,\\\"findingsFixed\\\":[\\\"Removed a pre-existing unused DatabaseSync type import from src/domains/messages/index.ts while editing its import block\\\",\\\"Three prior-story tests hard-coded pre-Story-5 state (stub routing in smoke.test.ts and cli-process.test.ts, schema version 3 in thread-migration.test.ts); updated them to the new reality and re-recorded hashes, following the exact pattern Story 4 used for the same files\\\"],\\\"findingsSurfaced\\\":[\\\"Within a single event, a close-triggered turn_derivation item precedes that event's message item in both result order and rowid order (transition runs before projection in the walk); no spec pins intra-event ordering, but Epic 02 should not assume message items precede turn items\\\",\\\"work_item.status is unconstrained TEXT (no CHECK), deliberately: this epic writes only 'queued' through code, and Epic 02 adds lifecycle statuses without a schema migration\\\"]},\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"specDeviations\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"Story verification, then epic close-out: the full TC table is green end to end (verify-all 111/111), Story 4's TC-3.3/TC-3.6 work-half debt is paid, the AC-4.6 rollback ladder is closed with the complete-surface regression, and the WorkItemRecord shape review against the epic contract table is done with no drift — this receipt records that named exit step.\\\"},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/05-derivation-work-queueing/003-implementor.json\\\"}],\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-10T14:50:05.133Z\\\",\\\"finishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-06-10T15:05:06.318Z\\\"}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_23\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,240p' packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/05-derivation-work-queueing/story-lead/001-current.json\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_23\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '1,240p' packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/05-derivation-work-queueing/story-lead/001-current.js